<title>USA: Sky Games venture signs marketing pact.</title>
<headline>Sky Games venture signs marketing pact.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sky Games International Ltd said that Interactive Entertainment Ltd, its entertainment joint venture with Harrah's Entertainment Inc, signed a strategic sales and marketing agreement with Nichimen Aviation Corp of Tokyo.</p>
<p>Word of the agreement, signed in Hamilton, Bermuda, was received in a release in Chicago.</p>
<p>Nichimen is a division of Nichimen Corp, a large general trading company in Japan.</p>
<p>Under terms of the pact, Nichimen Aviation will provide Interactive Entertainment with exclusive sales and marketing services in selected Asian markets.</p>
<p>((-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787))</p>
</text>
